  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The initial system is zirconium-alloy cladding with an elemental Cr coating deposited by conventional sputtering.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9318428::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 2–5 at% Al can be introduced into the Cr coating by co-sputtering.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9318428::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 2–5 at% Al to Cr will produce an in situ Al2O3 layer at the Cr–Zr interface.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting Al2O3 interlayer will be thin, uniform, finely dispersed, and well adhered.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al2O3 has sufficient thermodynamic stability and sufficiently low diffusivity under the proposed oxidizing conditions to function as an interfacial barrier.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al2O3 barrier will impede Cr–Zr atomic interdiffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-containing coating or its alumina barrier will limit oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9318428::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina barrier will preserve the protective role of the Cr matrix and maintain coating integrity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified Cr coating will have greater durability than elemental Cr coatings in both PWR primary water and accident-relevant high-temperature steam.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed coating is applicable to simulated PWR primary water at approximately 320 °C and 11.3 MPa for 20–60 days.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9318428::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed coating is applicable to short-duration steam exposure at temperatures up to approximately 1200 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9318428::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Elemental Cr coatings on zirconium-alloy cladding are prone to peeling and cracking during high-temperature steam oxidation.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9318428::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Elemental Cr coatings undergo accelerated Cr–Zr interdiffusion during high-temperature steam exposure.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to elemental Cr, the Al-modified coating will exhibit reduced interfacial elemental transport.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to elemental Cr, the Al-modified coating will exhibit enhanced oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9318428::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to elemental Cr, the Al-modified coating will retain its integrity for longer in both tested environments.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
